,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant/20 shadow-md\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full h-full object-cover\",\"alt\":\"Author portrait\",\"src\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDHqr642FyWGJoOiZp-JrM_4jTdGgu4Pa6IUUVTJk5yGbpt2oQS--BENfMtgrKWDgY_8cvHEFl5rIZVh7ySDomdU0wT3NyVId8T7-z0FnIvUj_USKaVABQFeaOxeL4UFvQTbEHn6W9hFpb-k9Ims7nLVNFKZcafNkyDO0-9EMagi7vIcvXKywrKjT06m3tNxPeYb9poFso6A_GpU83Qn5ria04gCfHP39eF7OghBANpXj-WWGa12zM8SPcEdIJL4_iFUBpa0MPFs-xh\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-tight drop-shadow-md\",\"children\":\"Najwan Octavian Gerrard\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-outline font-label text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-wider drop-shadow-md\",\"children\":[\"Lead Curator • \",\"2024-11-10\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:flex w-auto justify-end pl-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex flex-col items-end gap-4\",\"children\":[\"$L11\",\"$L12\"]}]}]]}]}]]}],\"$L13\"]}],\"$L14\"]\n11:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-[2px] h-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/0 via-primary/50 to-primary/0\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-headline text-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-widest [writing-mode:vertical-rl] drop-shadow-md\",\"children\":\"Scroll to Explore\"}]\n13:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 mb-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full space-y-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-invert max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Pada Blog ini akan memberikan panduan lengkap dalam memanfaatkan Harbor dan Trivy sebagai solusi keamanan images container yang nantinya akan digunakan di dalam Kubernetes. Dengan Harbor, Anda bisa mengelola private registry yang terstruktur dan aman, sedangkan Trivy membantu mendeteksi kerentanan pada image container, menjaga standar keamanan aplikasi yang Anda gunakan.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Tutorial ini juga menjelaskan cara mengintegrasikan Slack sebagai platform notifikasi, sehingga setiap hasil scan Trivy dapat langsung diinformasikan ke tim secara real-time. Notifikasi ini memungkinkan tim untuk merespons dengan cepat, memastikan langkah mitigasi yang efektif terhadap potensi ancaman.\"}],\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-0\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Latar Belakang\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Di Era digitalisasi sekarang yang semakin pesat, banyak perusahaan yang memerlukan solusi yang efektif dan handal dalam mengelola aplikasi yang bersifat fleksibel, otomatis serta aman dari kejahatan digital. Serta dengan adanya Cloud Computing menjadikan banyak perusahaan membutuhkan tools yang dapat di jalankan pada environment tersebut. Kubernetes menjadi salah satu tools yang paling banyak diminati oleh beberapa perusahaan, karena kemampuannya dalam mengelola container dalam skala besar.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Karena Hal tersebut juga menyebabkan adanya kebutuhan untuk penyimpanan Image private atau biasa disebut sebagai Private Registry agar menjaga keamanan dari perusahaannya, dan juga karena banyak nya kasus terkait pencurian data, menjadikan kebutuhan akan Scanning Vulnerability atau kerentanan menjadi cukup penting. Apalagi di era Cloud dan Containerisasi, Trivy dan Harbor merupakan salah satu solusi terkait dua hal tersebut. Yang dimana harbor sebagai tempat registry dan Trivy untuk scanning otomatis yang di trigger oleh Harbor saat ada event tertentu seperti Ada images yang baru di Push ke Harbor Registry.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Serta dibutuhkan juga Tools untuk mengirim notifikasi secara cepat dan otomatis, sehingga dapat secara cepat juga untuk mengatasi Vulnerability atau kerentanan terhadap Images yang akan di simpan di Harbor, malasah tersebut juga bisa diatasi dengan menggunakan Slack.\"}],\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-1\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Tools\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Kubernetes – v1.28.15\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Kubeadm\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"Kubectl\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"children\":\"Kubelet\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"children\":\"Harbor – 2.10.0\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-5\",{\"children\":\"Trivy – 0.47.0\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-6\",{\"children\":\"Docker – 27.3.1\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-7\",{\"children\":\"OpenSSL – 3.0.2\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L1e\",\"\\n\",\"$L1f\",\"\\n\",\"$L20\",\"\\n\",\"$L21\",\"\\n\",\"$L22\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L23\",\"\\n\",\"$L24\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L25\",\"\\n\",\"$L26\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L27\",\"\\n\",\"$L28\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L29\",\"\\n\",\"$L2a\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L2b\",\"\\n\",\"$L2c\",\"\\n\",\"$L2d\",\"\\n\",\"$L2e\",\"\\n\",\"$L2f\",\"\\n\",\"$L30\",\"\\n\",\"$L31\",\"\\n\",\"$L32\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L33\",\"\\n\",\"$L34\",\"\\n\",\"<br>\",\"\\n\",\"$L35\",\"\\n\",\"$L36\",\"\\n\",\"$L37\",\"\\n\",\"$L38\",\"\\n\",\"$L39\",\"\\n\",\"$L3a\",\"\\n\",\"$L3b\",\"\\n\",\"$L3c\",\"\\n\",\"$L3d\"]}]}]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full py-12 mt-20 bg-[#1a1c1e]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-headline font-bold text-[#5ED0D3] text-xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white font-headline\",\"children\":\"NAJWAN\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" Najwan. All rights reserved.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"WhatsApp\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/62895414361074\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"WhatsApp\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Email\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"mailto:najwanoctavian@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Email\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"GitHub\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/vianAja\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"GitHub\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"LinkedIn\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/najwan-octa/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"LinkedIn\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/topologi.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.19.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/harbor_config.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.1.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.2.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.3.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.4.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.5.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.6.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.7.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.8.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.9.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.10.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.1.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.2.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.3.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.4.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.5.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/10.6.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/hasil_slack.1.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/hasil_slack.2.png\",\"image\"]\n:HL[\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/failed_pull.png\",\"image\"]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-8\",{\"children\":\"Slack\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-2\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Topologi\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/topologi.png\",\"alt\":\"Branching\"}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-0\",{\"children\":\"Harbor\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Harbor adalah registry open source yang digunakan untuk menyimpan dan mengelola Images yang akan digunakan untuk membuat Container. Harbor sendiri cukup diminati karena mudahnya integrasi dengan tools scanning Vulnerability seperti Trivy atau Clair, yang memungkinkan untuk melakukan pengecekan kerentanan (Vulnerability) terhadap Images yang disimpan menjadi lebih mudah.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-1\",{\"children\":\"Trivy\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Trivy adalah salah satu tools scanning yang berbasis open source yang digunakan untuk mendeteksi kerentanan yang berfokus pada images container. Trivy memindai mulai dari Library atau Apps Dependencies (seperti Composer, npm, yarn) sampai kedalam Operating System (OS) yang digunakan, apakah aman atau tidak.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-2\",{\"children\":\"Slack\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"        Slack adalah tools komunikasi yang digunakan di tempat kerja, yang memungkinkan pengguna untuk mengirim pesan, file dan tools. Slack memiliki 2 metode, yaitu Direct Message (pesan langsung dari satu user ke user lain) dan Channel Group. Dan juga Slack dapat di integrasikan dengan aplikasi atau tools lain juga yang memungkinkan melakukan otomatisasi untuk notifikasi dari suatu aplikasi.\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-3\",{\"className\":\"font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Langkah Implementasi\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-3\",{\"children\":\"1. Install Docker Untuk Harbor Registry\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Panduan Dibahwah ini mencakup langkah-langkah konfigurasi Docker di sistem yang akan dibutuhkan, sehingga Anda dapat dengan mudah memahami dan mengimplementasikannya. Untuk dependensi yang dibutuhkan.\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"css\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-css\",\"children\":\"docker-ce                # Package utama Docker\\ndocker-ce-cli            # Package untuk CLI Docker\\ncontainerd.io            # Package untuk Container RunTime Docker\\ndocker-buildx-plugin     # Package untuk Membuat Image Docker\\ndocker-compose-plugin    # Package untuk Docker Compose\\n\"}]}]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Untuk lebih detail terkait pengertian dan langkah installasi, bisa kunjungi postingan saya yang berjudul \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://vianaja.github.io/blog-najwan/2024-10-01-install-docker/\",\"children\":\"Docker Container\"}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-4\",{\"children\":\"2. Create SSL Certificate untuk Harbor\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Membuat file Config IP SAN, agar SSL Certificate dapat membaca akses jika melalui IP, dan di simpan di directory \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“/etc/ssl/”\"}]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ echo \\\"subjectAltName=IP:<IP Address Node>\\\" > IP_SANS.txt\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Membuat Certificate dan Key untuk koneksi https pada Harbor, yang nantinya disimpan di directory \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“/etc/ssl/harbor/”\"}]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ sudo openssl genrsa -out harbor.key 4096\\n\\n~$ sudo openssl req -sha512 -new \\\\\\n    -subj \\\"/C=IN/ST=jateng/L=kendal/O=<Company Name>/OU=Personal/CN=<Domain>\\\"\\\\\\n    -key harbor.key \\\\\\n    -out harbor.csr\\n    \\n~$ sudo openssl x509 -req -sha512 -days 3650 \\\\\\n    -key harbor.key\\n    -extfile /etc/ssl/IP_SANS.ext \\\\\\n    -in harbor.csr \\\\\\n    -out harbor.crt\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-5\",{\"children\":\"3. Install Harbor\"}]\n26:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Download Source Code untuk harbor, lalu unzip file source code harbor yang sudah di download.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ wget https://github.com/goharbor/harbor/releases/download/v2.10.0/harbor-offline-installer-v2.10.0.tgz\\n~$ tar -xvzf harbor-offline-installer-v2.10.0.tgz\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Lalu edit pada file ”harbor.yaml”. sesuaikan seperti di contoh berikut.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ cp harbor.yml.tmpl harbor.yml\\n~$ nano harbor.yml\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-1\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"hostname: <IP or Domain> \\nhttp:\\n    port: 80\\nhttps:\\n    port: 443\\n    certificate: /path/to/ca_harbor.crt\\n    private_key: /path/to/ca_habror.key\\n\\nharbor_admin_password: <password admin harbor>\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Lalu jalankan script \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“install.sh”\"}]}],\" dengan parameter \",\"$L3e\",\"untuk secara otomatis integrasi Harbor dengan Trivy. Lalu verifikasi container komponen dari harbor nya berjalan dengan baik tanpa error.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L3f\",\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-6\",{\"children\":\"4. Konfigurasi Harbor untuk Trigger Scan Trivy saat ada Image yang baru di Push dan mengatur agar user dapat Pull Image dengan tingkat kerentanan yang rendah atau aman\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Login ke Harbor dengan user \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“admin”\"}]}],\", lalu masuk ke project yang ingin di konfigurasi.\\n\",[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/9.19.png\",\"alt\":\"Branching\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Lalu pilih \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“Configuration”\"}]}],\", kemudian centang pada bagian\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“Prevent vulnerable images from running.”\"}]}],\" Untuk mengatur agar user tidak dapat Pull Images dengan kerentanan yang tinggi. Contohnya di level \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"“Critical”\"}],\" (yang berbahaya sekali) atau yang Levelnya diatasnya lagi.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“Vulnerability Scanning”\"}]}],\". Untuk mengatur agar saat ada Push images akan secara otomatis di scanning.\\n\",[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/trivy-harbor-for-kubernetes/harbor_config.png\",\"alt\":\"Branching\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-7\",{\"children\":\"5. Install Kubernetes Cluster\"}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Pada langkah Installasi Kubernetes Cluster, bisa mengikuti dari Postingan saya \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://vianaja.github.io/blog-najwan/2024-11-02-kubernetes/\",\"children\":\"K8S Kubernetes\"}],\". Sudah ada juga penjelasan terkait Kubernetes Cluster. Pastikan Anda membaca panduan tersebut agar mendapatkan pemahaman yang menyeluruh sebelum melanjutkan untuk langkah berikutnya.\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-8\",{\"children\":\"6. Configuration SSL Certificate ke Cluster Kubernetes\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"relative py-8 px-12 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl border-l-4 border-primary my-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-primary/20 text-6xl font-headline\",\"children\":\"\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-headline italic text-white leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"Note: jalankan pada Node Master dan Worker\"}]}]}],\"\\n\"]}]]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-3\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Mengatur letak SSL Certificate untuk containerd pada semua Node yang ada di Cluster Kubenetes.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ sudo mkdir -p /etc/containerd/certs.d/\\n~$ sudo mkdir -p /etc/containerd/certs.d/<IP or Domain_registry>/\\n\\n# Example\\n~$ sudo mkdir -p /etc/containerd/certs.d/10.18.18.40:8443/    \\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Menambahkan / Copy SSL C